WEBVTT

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:10.880
What the heck? What's happening?

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.220
This place... isn't safe!

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.850
What do you mean?!

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:25.730
Thank you, ma'am.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:26.730
I'll handle it.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.900
Tiffa! Just in case, you should put on this hazmat-

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:46.670
Hurry! Get as far away as possible!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.130
What the heck is going on?! Is the explosion going to be that bad?

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.380
Stop talking, just run!

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:53.720
All right, fine!

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:00.220
He's out there risking his life, and here you are...

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:05.140
It's offensive.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:10.020
We're not going to make it...

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.070
What?!

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:31.970
<b>After War</b>

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:31.970
<b>GUNDAM</b>

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:39.470
<b>The dream I'd nearly forgotten is beginning to stir,</b>

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:42.430
<b>little by little</b>

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:46.980
<b>filling in the gaps in my heart</b>

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:54.360
<b>The instant my frozen memories begin to awaken,</b>

00:01:54.360 --> 00:02:03.870
<b>my only wish is for the future that is about to begin</b>

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:07.410
<b>I'll reach out with both hands</b>

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:11.420
<b>and embrace that dream I once had</b>

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:15.050
<b>I want to go on believing</b>

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:18.970
<b>without ever letting go or giving up</b>

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:22.610
<b>Until the day comes when I grab hold...</b>

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:26.470
<b>...of that dream I once had,</b>

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:30.040
<b>I want to keep chasing after it</b>

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:35.900
<b>without ever forgetting my hopes and dreams</b>

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:46.660
<b>Episode 7</b>

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:46.660
<b>"I'm Selling This Gundam!"</b>

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:49.080
The Satellite Cannon!

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:53.250
Oh, right! We can use the Satellite Cannon as a thruster!

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:57.670
Grab on!

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:58.970
Will there be time?!

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:10.640
Go!

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:15.360
It worked!

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:28.290
Looks like we survived somehow...

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:32.250
Ow... It didn't have to hit us that hard!

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.670
Any word from the Captain?

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.630
That's-

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:44.510
C-Captain!

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:48.100
Doctor!

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.520
How is he?!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:53.390
He needs surgery. Don't move the ship while I'm working on him.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:56.150
We'll move the ship to a safe location first, then.

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:58.270
Good idea.

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:02.070
All right, you heard him.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:08.870
Garrod!

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.750
This is all your-

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:17.080
I...

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.310
Let's go.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:53.450
Tiffa.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.460
Tiffa?

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.170
Tiffa, you're in there, right?

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.420
I...

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:03.920
No.

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:05.800
What's wrong?

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.720
What's the matter?

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:13.770
I don't want to see anyone right now.

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:02.150
I'll be right there.

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:12.950
This isn't like you. Why did you mess up?

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:16.580
A meltdown. In the reactor and in my men.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:22.040
Plus, this is rare prey. It would be a waste if I didn't capture it undamaged.

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.000
That makes sense.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.420
Have you found him?

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:26.340
No.

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:31.220
But I'll have something for you by dawn.

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:48.320
It really would be a waste...

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:11.590
His surgery should be wrapping up around now.

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:21.520
What a relief! The operation was a success!

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:26.860
Doc says he'll be out for a while, but I guess he's out of the woods.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.400
Now we need to decide what to do with Garrod.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:32.660
Yeah, this is the second time he's screwed up.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:38.700
You don't suppose he's just not cut out for working as part of a team, do you?

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:42.960
Maybe. But why do you think he tried to do that job by himself?

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:46.250
He was trying to show off to that Tiffa girl, obviously.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.960
If that's true, it was beyond reckless.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:50.920
He can't help it!

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:55.550
It's the male instinct to want to show off in front of the girl he likes.

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.160
Tiffa...

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:43.180
What are you doing there?

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:02.040
Launch order?

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:04.040
I didn't give any launch order.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.290
But Gundam Boy said-

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:28.600
But isn't this inside the danger zone? The Gundam wouldn't be hiding here.

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:34.530
That's why it's the perfect spot. It's worth checking out.

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:35.570
Hey!

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:37.110
Look at that!

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:40.280
Are those...

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:42.620
G-Gold bars?!

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:50.420
I can't believe my hiding spot was inside the damn blast radius...

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.040
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:55.590
I've been working myself to death to save that money for my family!

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:59.090
I won't let anyone lay a finger on it!

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:23.910
Hey, what do you think I should do?

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:30.920
Yeah, right... I can't expect you to answer me.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:36.670
I... What should I do?

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:42.010
Oh, well. It was fun while it lasted,

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:46.060
but you always end up alone again in the end...

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:50.020
It's back to the old days, that's all.

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.770
What a find!

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:58.490
We'll split it evenly without telling Boss Zakot!

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:00.150
You better believe it!

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:04.030
Okay, let's make tracks!

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:10.710
Put the case down and walk away peacefully!

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:14.130
Otherwise, I'm sending you all to Hell!

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:18.010
I don't think so.

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:21.300
There's three of us and only one of you.

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:23.930
Any way you look at it, you don't stand a chance.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:28.020
I think you should walk away.

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:47.330
If that's how you want it, suit yourselves!

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:57.130
Got it! Let's bug out!

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:57.920
Yeah! Yeah!

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:00.300
Come back here!

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:10.470
You're not getting away! I'll follow you to the gates of Hell if I have to!

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:12.770
He's gonna catch up to us!

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:15.230
Damn it, go bring reinforcements!

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:16.020
On it!

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:27.950
Oh, my. A mission from the Freeden, huh?

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:32.410
Are you sure that you only want to call in Roabea?

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.290
It's for financial reasons.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:38.000
Oh, right. It's been nothing but expenses lately.

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:41.920
We don't have enough to afford two or three mobile suit pilots.

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:45.510
I can't believe he ran off while the Captain's hurt!

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:48.850
When Garrod gets back, I'm gonna let him have it!

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:51.560
Will he come back?

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:23.920
Right! My mind's made up!

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:28.430
A change in plans?

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:31.760
Yeah, we found a mobile suit pilot's stash of gold bars, and-

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:33.390
Open the gate.

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:36.390
It's the Gundam that I'm interested in.

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:40.980
That's not true.

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:52.870
Pops, are you done with my repairs yet?

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:56.000
You bet! She's as good as new!

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:59.370
Stop exaggerating. So, how much do I owe you?

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:01.840
Let's see...

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:08.130
2.5 million... I'd like to say, but I'll take 2 million.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:10.760
That's awfully reasonable.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:13.600
In return... I have a favor to ask.

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.430
A favor?

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:24.270
Okay, here we go!

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:26.190
R-Ready!

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:27.860
Okay, say cheese!

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:32.660
This'll do nicely!

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:38.210
When word gets out that I work on Gundams, it'll give my business a boost!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:39.620
Hello?!

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:41.540
A customer already!

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:47.340
My good man, please don't confuse me with those other repair shops in town!

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:51.720
You see, I work on those world-famous Gundams...

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:58.730
I-It's another Gundam!

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:04.650
Hey, Pops! I'll pay you for it, so let me use your lot for a while!

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.240
Also, can you call in the local info brokers?

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:12.700
Info brokers? What in the world are you going to do?

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.120
I'm selling this Gundam!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:26.550
I got no choice... I need accuracy more than speed!

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:31.550
We've got this!

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:34.800
Reinforcements are here, huh?

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:37.600
A Gundam is being put up for sale?

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:42.230
Yeah, a GX-9900 that's as good as new!

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:45.440
I wonder if the auction's started already?

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.830
Okay, let's get started!

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:06.340
Make sure you bid high, everybody!

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:14.550
If I steal it, it won't cost me anything.

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:17.100
Oh. But first...

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:24.190
That was a little demonstration.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:29.150
I've planted much more powerful charges than that in various places.

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:33.990
Plus, even if the remote doesn't work, they're also hooked up to a timer.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:38.580
Killing me and taking it for free won't work.

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:41.790
Okay, we give! This kid is no dummy!

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:45.250
So, why don't we start the bidding at 50 million?

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:46.710
55 million!

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:47.750
60 million!

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:50.500
How about 62 million?

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:56.430
Come on, people! This isn't your ordinary mobile suit!

00:16:56.550 --> 00:16:59.850
Let's see some real bids! Go for it!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.890
Okay, 90 million!

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.770
That's more like it!

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:05.100
92 million!

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:06.100
What?

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:11.530
The lowball bid strategy again? Have a heart, will ya?

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:14.490
Okay, how about 100 million?!

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.160
Pops, you're awesome!

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:20.370
Okay, any other bids?

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:25.500
If not, this nice gentleman is gonna become a Gundam pilot!

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.580
Looks like that's it!

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:32.000
Okay, our winner is the man in the beard!

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:33.760
Oh, yeah!

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:46.100
I'm finally a Gundam pilot...

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.940
Just a minute, sir!

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:50.150
Why?!

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:54.940
This auction has a bonus round.

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:59.360
This Gundam won't work without this controller.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:04.790
Y-You dirty punk!

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:07.330
So, what will you bid for this?!

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:09.290
300 million.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.640
300 million for everything.

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:26.640
300 million?!

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:29.100
Is that all right?

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:33.770
Sure...

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:51.420
Okay, you've got nowhere left to run!

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:54.040
Be good boys and return what's mine!

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:55.750
Like hell!

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:15.150
I see. So you don't intend to go back to your crewmates.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:19.690
Not really. I've got nowhere to go and no one who's waiting for me.

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.110
I'm back to my freewheeling loner ways.

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:23.950
All I need is money.

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:27.790
I get the hint, my crewmates will bring it in the morning.

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:29.660
Can I take your word on that?

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:32.750
I don't want you sneaking up on me in the middle of the night...

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:34.580
...and strangling me in my sleep.

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:38.760
You hid the Gundam to keep that from happening, right?

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.510
Pretty much.

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:41.590
Tell me.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:45.180
Ask all you want, you're not prying the hiding spot out of me.

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:47.140
No, not that.

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:50.680
What do you and I look like?

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:16.420
Way to waste my time...

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:22.720
What the...?

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.020
This isn't even funny.

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:50.240
This was the right call, wasn't it?

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:55.420
Sons of...

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:01.550
Crap! My rifle's out of energy?

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:07.090
Looks like you used up all your power on the way here.

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:10.640
We'll be taking that gold and that Gundam!

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:13.100
Fire Clock Squad, take positions!

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:19.860
Wh-What're they doing?

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.910
Commence attack, starting from Midnight!

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.330
9 o'clock Platoon!

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:35.000
3 o'clock squad!

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:41.380
Up is my only option!

00:21:42.340 --> 00:21:45.340
Don't let him escape! Roast the pilot alive!

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:16.120
Were you still awake?

00:22:45.650 --> 00:22:50.950
<b>Can I find the words to tell you</b>

00:22:47.900 --> 00:22:50.320
The Frost Brothers, hungry for revenge,

00:22:50.320 --> 00:22:53.410
appear before Garrod, who has quit the Freeden.

00:22:50.950 --> 00:22:56.330
<b>How I live between the walls of steel and stone</b>

00:22:53.450 --> 00:23:01.750
Meanwhile, Ennil and Zakot's group decide to attack the Freeden to lure out the Gundam X.

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:04.170
<b>How I close my eyes to find some kind of rapture</b>

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:10.510
<b>In a world where you can feel so all alone</b>

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:17.520
<b>Inside I'm full of light and laughter</b>

00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:21.390
<b>There's a flame that burns in me</b>

00:23:21.390 --> 00:23:22.350
<b>(I need a way)</b>

00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:26.440
<b>(I need a way) I need a way to set it free</b>

00:23:26.440 --> 00:23:31.360
<b>When you find love in your heart</b>

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:33.490
<b>(The human touch)</b>

00:23:33.490 --> 00:23:37.540
<b>You can believe from the start</b>

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:39.540
<b>(From the start)</b>

00:23:40.460 --> 00:23:42.670
<b>Dreams they come true</b>

00:23:42.670 --> 00:23:44.040
<b>(They come true)</b>

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:48.380
<b>All comes to you, oh all at once</b>

00:23:48.380 --> 00:23:52.180
<b>If you believe in human touch</b>

00:23:50.010 --> 00:23:52.550
I'll make that boy pay!

00:23:51.340 --> 00:23:55.600
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:23:51.340 --> 00:23:55.600
<b>"I'll Make that Boy Pay!"</b>

00:23:55.600 --> 00:23:57.600
<b></b>
